.cursor/
*.md
!README.md

# The water-knowledge wiki is data the agent reads at runtime, not docs —
# re-include it after the blanket *.md exclusion above. Its raw/ scans are not
# needed in the image (the agent answers from wiki/ only).
!water_knowledge/wiki/*.md
!water_knowledge/wiki/**/*.md
water_knowledge/raw/

deploy/
